Upstream tracking describes itself as a reimplementation of BeyondMimic,
based on HybridRobotics/whole_body_tracking
f8e20c880d9c8ec7172a13d3a88a65e3a5a88448.

Gobot modifications: scene-based articulation integration, explicit motion name
mapping and validation, independent sampling state, CPU/Warp contact sensing,
training checkpoint contracts, and local evaluation. Runtime imports no mjlab.
